 tance of these rules and the decisions of the Sponsor\, which are final an
 d binding. Winning a prize is contingent on being compliant with these rul
 es and fulfilling all other requirements set forth herein. 5. Contest Peri
 od: The contest begins on October 1\, 2026\, and the deadline to submit th
 e winter photo entries is 11:59 E.T. on November 14\, 2026. Entries that a
 re submitted before or after the contest period will be disqualified. Subm
 issions will be accepted for the duration of the contest using the online 
 method only. 6. How to Enter: Online will be the only method of entry that
  is available\, it is available through&nbsp\;by email to&nbsp\; Jfiler@dn
